    "oneLiner": "Rust-based Minecraft server with multi-threading and plugin extensibility.",
    "whatItDoes": "Pumpkin is a Minecraft server implementation written in Rust, designed for high performance and compatibility with both Java and Bedrock editions. It leverages multi-threading for efficient resource utilization and adheres to Vanilla game mechanics while offering extensive configuration options. Its plugin system and modular architecture make it suitable for custom server setups.",
    "keyFeatures": [
      "Multi-threading: Optimizes performance across CPU cores for faster server operations.",
      "Protocol support: Handles Java and Bedrock editions with encryption and packet compression.",
